PAL16L8
DOP2E
Dopple Board Arbitration PAL 8/16 bit
Scott Statton, Developer Resources,Mtn. View, CA

HCE HWE HOE TCE TWE0 TWE1 TOE WHO WP GND
PIN11 RAMCE HADDR TADDR HDATA TDATA R/W RAMWE RAMOE VCC

IF (VCC) /HADDR =
	 /HCE * WHO

IF (VCC) /HDATA =
	 /HCE * /HOE * WHO +
	 /HCE * /HWE * WHO

IF (VCC) /TADDR =
	 /WHO

IF (VCC) /TDATA =
	 /TCE * /TOE * /WHO +
	 /TCE * /TWE0 * /WP * /WHO +
	 /TCE * /TWE1 * /WP * /WHO

IF (VCC) /R/W =
	/HCE * /HWE * WHO +
	/TCE * /TWE0*/WP*/WHO +
	/TCE * /TWE1*/WP*/WHO

IF (VCC) /RAMWE =
	 /HCE * /HWE * WHO +
	 /TCE * /TWE0 * /WP * /WHO +
	 /TCE * /TWE1 * /WP * /WHO

IF (VCC) /RAMCE =
	 /HCE * WHO +
	 /TCE * /WHO +
	 /TCE * /TWE0 * /WHO * /WP +
	 /TCE * /TWE1 * /WHO * /WP

IF (VCC) /RAMOE =
	 /HCE * /HOE * WHO +
	 /TOE * /WHO

FUNCTION TABLE


HCE HWE HOE TCE TWE0 TWE1 TOE WHO WP HADDR
HDATA TADDR TDATA R/W RAMWE RAMCE RAMOE

;             T  T          | H  H  T  T     R  R  R
; H  H  H  T  W  W  T  W    | A  D  A  D  R  A  A  A
; C  W  O  C  E  E  O  H  W | D  A  D  A  /  W  C  O
; E  E  E  E  0  1  E  O  P | R  T  R  T  W  E  E  E
--------------------------------------------------------
  H  X  X  H  X  X  X  H  X   X  X  X  X  X  X  H  X
  H  X  X  H  X  X  X  L  X   X  X  X  X  X  X  H  X
  L  H  L  L  L  L  L  H  X   L  L  H  H  H  H  L  L
  L  L  H  L  L  L  L  H  X   L  L  H  H  L  L  L  H
  L  L  L  L  H  H  L  L  X   H  H  L  L  H  H  L  L
  L  L  L  L  L  L  H  L  L   H  H  L  L  L  L  L  H
--------------------------------------------------------
END
